{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026eQTXjm3P8e1795739351.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>英國廣播公司周四報道，根據美國總統特朗普公開投資申報文件顯示，他的投資組合帳戶在今年首九個月，共交易44次輝達股票。而特朗普帳戶在去年底持有輝達股票的價值，介乎1,250萬至5,800萬美元之間。他申報文件僅披露交易金額的高低範圍，無從精準分析實際交易情況。</p><p></p><p>白宮解釋，特朗普投資組合由第三方獨立管理，他和家人無法指示或影響管理人如何投資。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T02:03:57.642983+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":170,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T00:27:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T16:17:34.761723+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T01:57:18.230747+00:00","content_hash":"d66eb5afbcf1ac50df7b400b141f2a00bccdec12e00f09b075a2dca01f930ea5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-27T02:03:57.642983+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}